  "contentHtml": "<p>5월26일 수요일 저녁에 완전한 <i><b>개기월식 </b></i>이 일어난다고 하네요~</p><p>(지구와 달이 가까워져 생기는 슈퍼문과 개기월식이 동시에!)</p><p>경기도융합과학교육원, 국립과천과학관 유투브 채널에서 생중계를 한다는 소식을 듣고, 안내 자료를 만들어보았습니다&#128521;</p><p>혹시, 필요하신 선생님들께서는 마음껏 활용하세요~</p><p>&#160;</p><p><b>* 미리캔버스 링크</b> : <a href=\"https://www.miricanvas.com/v/1emq3s\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"ke-link\">https://www.miricanvas.com/v/1emq3s</a></p><div class=\"figure-open\" contenteditable=\"false\" data-ke-type=\"opengraph\" data-ke-align=\"alignCenter\" data-og-type=\"website\" data-og-title=\"제목을 입력해주세요.\" data-og-description=\"위 이미지는 무료 디자인툴 미리캔버스에서 만들었어요.\" data-og-host=\"www.miricanvas.com\" data-og-source-url=\"https://www.miricanvas.com/v/1emq3s\" data-og-url=\"http://www.miricanvas.com/v/1emq3s\" data-og-image=\"https://scrap.kakaocdn.net/dn/bCxvfP/hyKjNulfTV/8kOghkcoTl8nLD5Q4WubcK/img.jpg?width=800&amp;height=800&amp;face=0_0_800_800,https://scrap.kakaocdn.net/dn/Vzu6x/hyKjGIK1ID/GZZXdOqXgNvYJaz6qlmeoK/img.jpg?width=800&amp;height=800&amp;face=0_0_800_800\"><a href=\"https://www.miricanvas.com/v/1emq3s\" target=\"_blank\" data-source-url=\"https://www.miricanvas.com/v/1emq3s\"><div class=\"og-image\" style=\"background-image:url(https://scrap.kakaocdn.net/dn/bCxvfP/hyKjNulfTV/8kOghkcoTl8nLD5Q4WubcK/img.jpg?width=800&amp;height=800&amp;face=0_0_800_800,https://scrap.kakaocdn.net/dn/Vzu6x/hyKjGIK1ID/GZZXdOqXgNvYJaz6qlmeoK/img.jpg?width=800&amp;height=800&amp;face=0_0_800_800)\"></div><div class=\"og-text\"><p class=\"og-title\">제목을 입력해주세요.</p><p class=\"og-desc\">위 이미지는 무료 디자인툴 미리캔버스에서 만들었어요.</p><p class=\"og-host\">www.miricanvas.com</p></div></a></div><p><b>* 뉴스 </b><b>자료</b> : <a href=\"https://www.yna.co.kr/view/AKR20210520044300017?input=1195m\" target=\"_top\" class=\"ke-link\">https://www.yna.co.kr/view/AKR20210520044300017?input=1195m</a>&#160;</p><p><a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=znIZ8SA0wUc&amp;feature=emb_logo\" target=\"_top\" class=\"ke-link\">https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=znIZ8SA0wUc&amp;featur